1
00:00:00,761 --> 00:00:04,221
(Bernadette:)There were a few moments today
when I felt like we were a little family.

2
00:00:04,431 --> 00:00:05,731
- Really?
- Yeah.

3
00:00:05,933 --> 00:00:08,763
(Bernadette:)I never thought of myself as a mom,
but when we were out...

4
00:00:09,002 --> 00:00:11,032
...I felt like someday we could do it.

5
00:00:11,705 --> 00:00:12,895
(Howard:)Of course we can.

6
00:00:14,575 --> 00:00:19,275
(Howard:)Especially if our baby's
as calm and quiet as little Cinnam...

7
00:00:19,513 --> 00:00:21,673
Son of a bitch, she's gone!

8
00:00:22,282 --> 00:00:25,412
- Well, where'd she go?
- I don't know. She didn't leave a note.

9
00:00:27,187 --> 00:00:29,417
You were supposed to put her
back in the stroller.

10
00:00:29,590 --> 00:00:31,420
- No, I wasn't. You were.
- No, I wasn't.

11
00:00:31,658 --> 00:00:34,558
- Yes, you were.
- Yeah, well, you throw like a girl.

12
00:00:42,202 --> 00:00:44,032
(Sheldon:)I'm getting worried.

13
00:00:45,038 --> 00:00:47,668
(Penny:)Relax, Sheldon,
he's only a few minutes late.

14
00:00:47,875 --> 00:00:50,465
(Sheldon:)Professor Proton was never late
when he was on TV.

15
00:00:50,711 --> 00:00:52,971
You know, every day, 4:00, he was there.

16
00:00:54,181 --> 00:01:02,021
(Sheldon:)Unless tornadoes were ripping apart
East Texas, then we'd join him in progress.

